  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What and who",
      "items": [
        "A quality-gated job-search agent for one person",
        "Discovers, scores, tailors a résumé, drafts the application",
        "Two frontends, one data path: both call context.py and actions.py"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Why the gate comes first",
      "items": [
        "The hard filter is deterministic, free, and retires jobs permanently",
        "Only survivors cost a model call, capped by max_score_per_run",
        "Credibility is scored from the verified facts store, never invented"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Rails and rhythm",
      "items": [
        "SUBMISSION_IMPLEMENTED ships False, so every real send is refused",
        "An unanswerable form question parks the run instead of guessing",
        "Two independent state machines in run_state: pipeline and apply"
      ]
    }
